<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>Vitajoy - (built 1971) 31,695 dwt sold to Indian breakers for $158 per ldt.</p>
<p>Ocean K - (built 1964) 25,701 dwt sold to Indian breakers for $160 per ldt.</p>
<p>Divine Splendour - (built 1972) 16,424 dwt sold to intermediary buyers to be sold onwards for $178 per ldt.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
